[D Quests for Blackrock Depths \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 52-57 Blackrock Depths]
[NX 55-60 Blackmaw Hold]

Blackrock Depths lies deep inside Blackrock Mountain, between the Searing Gorge and the Burning Steppes. You enter the mountain from either zone, drop down the hanging chain from the Blackrock Spire ledge and keep to the low path to the Depths portal. The dungeon is huge, so both factions run it three times: chains go on only after hand-ins outside.

-- Left out: 3441, 3442, 3443, 3452, 3453, 3454, 3462, 3463, 3481 (Kalaran Windblade's Searing Gorge chain) and 4022: they only earn the Black Dragonflight Molt for A Taste of Flame; 4023 from Cyrus gets the same molt from the drake he calls (QuestieDB: 4024 needs one of 4022 or 4023). 4128 Ragnar Thunderbrew (Blasted Lands) and 4324 Yuka Screwspigot (Tanaris): optional breadcrumbs (Dungeon Journal), far off the road. 4201 The Love Potion: needs Gromsblood, Giant Silver Veins from Azshara and a vial filled in Un'Goro first. 7604 A Binding Contract: needs a Sulfuron Ingot from Molten Core and level 60. 9015 The Challenge: the end of the Dire Maul chain from Anthion Harmon. 7848 Attunement to the Core: in the Molten Core guide. 6402 Stormwind Rendezvous onward: the Onyxia attunement, after Jail Break!.

